{
 "title": "Chapter 7: A Wall Made of Other Countries",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Chapter 7: A Wall Made of Other Countries",
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "s08b01",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "After the war, the Soviet Union took control of *Eastern* Europe.",
     "shot": "c7_after",
     "date": 1945,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Europe",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b02",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "*Poland*.",
     "shot": "map:bloc",
     "date": 1948,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Poland",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b03",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "*East* Germany.",
     "shot": "map:bloc",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Germany",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b04",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "*Hungary*.",
     "shot": "map:bloc",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Hungary",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b05",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "*Romania*.",
     "shot": "map:bloc",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Romania",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b06",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "*Bulgaria*.",
     "shot": "map:bloc",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Bulgaria",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b07",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "These countries formed a *buffer* between Moscow and the West.",
     "shot": "map:bloc"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b08",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "For Stalin, it was *security*.",
     "shot": "c7_twoviews",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:security",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b09",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "For the people who lived there, it meant *repression* and lost independence.",
     "shot": "c7_twoviews"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b10",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The buffer *worked*, in its way.",
     "shot": "c7_super"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b11",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The Soviet Union became one of *two* superpowers.",
     "shot": "c7_super",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:superpowers",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b12",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It launched *Sputnik* in 1957.",
     "shot": "c7_sputnik",
     "date": 1957,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "blip",
       "w:Sputnik",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b13",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "It sent Yuri *Gagarin* into orbit in 1961,",
     "shot": "c7_gagarin",
     "date": 1961,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       "w:orbit",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b14",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "exactly a *century* after freeing its serfs.",
     "shot": "c7_gagarin",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:century",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b15",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It also tested the Tsar Bomba, the *largest* nuclear weapon ever detonated.",
     "shot": "c7_bomba",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "rumble",
       "w:detonated",
       0.5
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b16",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "But behind the achievements was an economy that *struggled*.",
     "shot": "c7_economy",
     "date": 1975
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b17",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "A huge *military* budget.",
     "shot": "c7_economy",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "drum",
       "w:military",
       0.3
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b18",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And a costly war in *Afghanistan*, starting in 1979.",
     "shot": "c7_economy",
     "date": 1979
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b19",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "In 1986, the *Chernobyl* reactor exploded.",
     "shot": "c7_chernobyl",
     "date": 1986,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:exploded",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b20",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The government's first attempt to *hide* it deepened public distrust.",
     "shot": "c7_chernobyl",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "paper",
       "w:hide",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b21",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "Mikhail Gorbachev tried to *reform* the system.",
     "shot": "c7_gorby",
     "date": 1987,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:reform",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b22",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "And the reforms helped bring it *down*.",
     "shot": "c7_gorby",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:down",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b23",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On December 25, 1991, the *red* flag came down over the Kremlin.",
     "shot": "c7_flagdown",
     "date": 1991,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:down",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b24",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "*Fifteen* new countries emerged.",
     "shot": "map:breakup",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pops",
       "w:countries",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b25",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Russia was the *largest*.",
     "shot": "map:breakup",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "ding",
       "w:largest",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b26",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "But it had lost territory, population, and the *buffer* Stalin had built.",
     "shot": "map:breakup"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b27",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "About *25* million ethnic Russians suddenly lived outside its borders.",
     "shot": "c7_borders"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b28",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "They *hadn't* moved.",
     "shot": "c7_borders"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b29",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "The *borders* had.",
     "shot": "c7_borders",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:borders",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b30",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The 1990s were *brutal*.",
     "shot": "c7_nineties",
     "date": 1992,
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b31",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "The economy *collapsed*.",
     "shot": "c7_nineties",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:collapsed",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b32",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Savings *vanished*.",
     "shot": "c7_nineties",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "whoosh",
       "w:vanished",
       0.4
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b33",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Life expectancy for Russian men *fell* sharply.",
     "shot": "c7_nineties",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:fell",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b34",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "Births *dropped* hard.",
     "shot": "c7_nineties",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "slide_down",
       "w:dropped",
       0.3
      ]
     ],
     "quiet": true
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b35",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "And that drop is *important*.",
     "shot": "c7_gap"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b36",
     "type": "INSERT",
     "text": "It created a *gap* in the population that echoes through Russia today.",
     "shot": "c7_gap"
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b37",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "On the last day of 1999, Boris Yeltsin *resigned*.",
     "shot": "c7_yeltsin",
     "date": 1999,
     "sfx": [
      [
       "thud",
       "w:resigned",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "s08b38",
     "type": "STORY",
     "text": "He handed power to a former intelligence officer named Vladimir *Putin*.",
     "shot": "c7_yeltsin",
     "sfx": [
      [
       "pop",
       "w:Putin",
       0.4
      ]
     ]
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}